<title>USA: TABLE - GeoScience Corp Q2 sales, net rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GeoScience Corp Q2 sales, net rise.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.05		    $0.03</p>
<p> Net		 461			228</p>
<p> Sales	     23,322		   19,996</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,101		   9,185</p>
<p>		   6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.06		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net		 650			602</p>
<p> Sales	     46,652		   38,869</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,162		   8,542</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net includes the loss from discontinued software operation, CogniSeis Development Inc. GeoScience has signed a letter of intent to sell CogniSeis to Paradigm and expects to recognize an after-tax gain of about $5 million.</p>
<p>Q2 96 lessened by $0.09 a share from discontinued operations of CogniSeis. Q2 96 lessened by $0.12 a share from CogniSeis.</p>
<p>Six-month 97 lessened by $0.16 a share from CogniSeis, annd and six-month 96 lessened by $0.21 a share from discontinued operations of CogniSeis.</p>
